#   RIPEMD-256 and -320: libtomcrypt, Bouncy Castle 1.54, Crypto++ and
#               RustCrypto's ripemd 0.2.0;
#   HAS-160:    RHash, Botan 1.10.17 and GNU Crypto;
#   Whirlpool-0: sphlib and GNU Crypto's Whirlpool2000;
