#   MD6:        the MIT reference implementation (with its 2009-04-15 fix)
#               and Jacksum's Java port of it - a translation, not a
#               second design.
# Each was also checked against the test vectors in its own sources,
# where it has any (the MD6 sources carry none).
#
# An input is one of:
#   message = hex bytes ("-" is empty)
#   pattern = n    the n bytes (i * 167 + 29) mod 256 for i = 0..n-1
#   repeat = byte count   the byte, count times

